#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:4
msgid "Certificate Authorities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| integrates with external Certificate Authority (CA) services "
"to automate certificate issuance, renewal, and lifecycle management. CA "
"integrations are managed from |InfTruSer| (Infrastructure > Trust > "
"Services)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:11
msgid ""
"When a CA integration is active, |morpheus| can request certificates "
"directly from the CA, eliminating manual CSR submission workflows and "
"enabling automated certificate provisioning during Instance creation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:14
msgid "Supported CA Integrations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:16
msgid "|morpheus| supports the following Certificate Authority integrations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Venafi Trust Protection Platform:** Enterprise certificate lifecycle "
"management"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Microsoft Active Directory Certificate Services (ADCS):** Windows PKI "
"infrastructure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:20
msgid ""
"**HashiCorp Vault PKI:** Vault PKI secrets engine for dynamic certificate"
" generation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Let's Encrypt (ACME):** Free, automated SSL certificates via ACME "
"protocol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:24
msgid "Adding a CA Integration"
msgstr ""

