msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:54
msgid ""
"Once saved, |morpheus| will validate connectivity to the CA service and "
"display the integration status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:57
msgid "Requesting Certificates from a CA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:59
msgid "With an active CA integration, certificates can be requested directly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:61
msgid "Navigate to |InfTruCer|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:63
msgid "Select the certificate type associated with your CA integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:64
msgid "Fill in the certificate subject information:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:66
msgid "**COMMON NAME:** FQDN for the certificate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:67
msgid "**ORGANIZATION / OU / LOCALITY / STATE / COUNTRY:** Subject fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:68
msgid "**KEY SIZE:** Desired key length"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:69
msgid "**CA INTEGRATION:** Select the target CA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:71
msgid "Click :guilabel:`REQUEST CERTIFICATE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:73
msgid ""
"|morpheus| submits the request to the CA and, upon approval, stores the "
"issued certificate automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:76
msgid "Certificate Renewal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:78
msgid ""
"For certificates issued through CA integrations, |morpheus| tracks "
"expiration dates and can facilitate renewal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:80
msgid "Certificates approaching expiration are flagged in the certificate list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:81
msgid ""
"Renewal can be triggered manually by signing the existing CSR again "
"through the CA integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:82
msgid ""
"Automated renewal policies depend on the specific CA integration "
"capabilities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:85
msgid "Refreshing CA Data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:87
msgid "To refresh certificates and metadata from a CA integration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:90
msgid "Select the CA integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:91
msgid "Click :guilabel:`REFRESH` from the Actions menu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:93
msgid ""
"This synchronizes the latest certificate inventory and status from the "
"external CA."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:96
msgid "Deleting a CA Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:99
msgid ""
"Click the trash icon or select :guilabel:`DELETE` from the Actions menu "
"on the integration row"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:100
msgid "Confirm deletion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:102
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/certificate_authorities.rst:102
msgid ""
"Removing a CA integration does not delete certificates that were "
"previously issued through it. Those certificates remain in |morpheus| "
"until manually removed."
msgstr ""

